갈 (58)"]},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"불가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"},{"k":"안전시설현황","v":"소화기 (35) · 방화사 (1) · 화재감지기 (6)","items":["소화기 (35)","방화사 (1)","화재감지기 (6)"]}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/7485HyCHCpUJgBClJoGKxNKw.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/4779NJ0XTtNt5nRqwNzOJai3.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/8063QuI8ggvi6N9B66hJLK3l.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/7263OWGWW0m8DO0YGCPxA7yG.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/52815Zmpz0OcfgLJDA7wv7Th.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/3724nGLjolKiyvDfgvuXW51N.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/93755PqqJtnVvAuKqI2fpgS2.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/8863iYs6RHyitZKOLDtrbDLj.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/2855MpctJ2eo4g2GqwTf6yNF.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/8694nyX6gAfaK0vjscReRkpw.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/95991Q9qqKEqTGvVIi7ZxuyK.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/5920SInoDB3Jz4NJ2lZ9Rj4A.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/6494AN4buMr3ExMlLxC0RjgU.jpg"],"layout":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/6980/0961xG2UpZf3S8ki2jufy4jW.jpg"],"guide":[{"title":"일반캠핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"일반","values":["35,000","35,000","45,000","45,000"]}]}},{"title":"오토캠핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"오토캠핑","values":["40,000","40,000","50,000","50,000"]}]}},{"title":"글램핑","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"글램핑","values":["130,000","130,000","150,000","150,000"]}]},"images":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/cvntl/383/9546W2xMVi0gkZwlMDXhkzG3.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/cvntl/382/0149tUPUSLzvKzMCcIVtPnfh.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/cvntl/381/50533TMMBAzlvWWglg3TK3E6.jpg","https://www.gocam